# testscene_2: Clockwork: Scale/Rotate petals, ConcatTransform, Transform, mirror Scale, CoordSysTransform
# Category: camera. Petals from a sphere under non-uniform Scale and Rotate, a star placed by ConcatTransform, a pennant and its mirror image (Scale -1 1 1), a spiral staircase built by accumulating Rotate + Translate with its top named by CoordinateSystem and reused by CoordSysTransform, and a ring of cubes in a frame set by an absolute Transform. Checks the whole transform stack.
# Reference: testsuite_ref_2.pfm, rendered by pbrt-v4 from testscene_2_pbrt.pbrt (same scene; only Integrator, Sampler and Film differ).
# pbrt-v4 version of testscene_2.pbrt, used to render the reference image.
